item.description:
Two cancer care professionals became patients themselves – and discovered just how powerful their friendship could be. Why a church parking lot could be your next home.&nbsp;A 2026 CNN Hero who once relied on food pantries is reimagining how Chicago families get the food they need. A 2024 study estimated that 52 million Americans struggle with loneliness – find out what CNN learned from experts about how to combat that. Plus, how a scheduling shakeup turned into a big win for fans at this year's WNBA Finals.&nbsp;

Host/Producer: Krista Bo Polanco&nbsp;

Producer: Eryn Mathewson&nbsp;&nbsp;

Senior Producer: Felicia Patinkin&nbsp;

Editorial Support: Kathleen Toner, Samantha Delouya,&nbsp;Don Riddell&nbsp;
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices

